  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing an application laboratory in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: This project has been cancelled, because the applicant has requested to prematurely terminate the project.The applicant is a manufacturer of food ingredients, especially for improving the taste of food. The food industry in the Middle East is increasing, so the market for the applicant as well. One of the services that are offered to the customers is taste sessions for their products after adding specific ingredients. As this service is now offered in the Netherlands, this is costly for the customers.Also, the partners expect that the taste is more in line with the reality when it is performed in the region of the customers. So they decided to establish a taste laboratory in Amman.The applicant is Fromatech Ingredients B.V. from Sittard, the Netherlands and the local partner is Al-Behar Industries Co. Ltd. from Amman. The partners will set up a joint venture company for the project.The project will introduce a very innovative activity to the region and will support further development of the food processing industry in the region. The partners have knowledge and network to make the project succeed.</narrative>
  </description>
